# Torch the Tower deals 2 damage to Keen-Eyed Curator (a 3/3), which survives; the spell's replacement effect (CR 611.2c,
# 614.1a) stays on it for the turn, so when a Lightning Bolt then kills it, it is exiled instead of dying. Llanowar Elves
# was never dealt damage by Torch the Tower, so the Bolt that kills it puts it into the graveyard (the negative control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Torch the Tower
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Forest
Keen-Eyed Curator
Llanowar Elves
Forest x16

